# Production build (npm run build, NODE_ENV=production).
# Deployed BluConnet backend. NOTE: this hostname used to be stored with the
# last two letters transposed (bluconnet-backend-m2jl.onrender.com) — that host
# is not a Render service at all, so every request to it answered
# "404 x-render-routing: no-server" and the live News page + Home recent-news
# section stayed empty. The correct service is m2lj.
REACT_APP_API_URL=https://bluconnet-backend-m2lj.onrender.com/api
VITE_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=6LdLvswtAAAAAPscdvooAkP_xxfRN6rHMIT2wsdD
# reCAPTCHA v2 "I'm not a robot" Checkbox site key — used ONLY to render
# Google's real checkbox when the existing v3 badge is clicked/tapped
# (components/RecaptchaV2Checkbox.jsx). The v3 key above is unchanged: v3 keeps
# protecting the API/form submissions exactly as before.
REACT_APP_RECAPTCHA_V2_SITE_KEY=6LcKpdMtAAAAANJ0G7HTcYkOQgyLNKm7Ox2rDonX